388
00:32:12.639 --> 00:32:14.474
Kenapa pintu terbuka?

389
00:32:16.017 --> 00:32:17.727
Adakah seseorang tinggal di sini sekarang?

390
00:32:17.810 --> 00:32:18.645
Tidak.

391
00:32:19.228 --> 00:32:20.104
